area: what changed, imperative, 72 characters at the outside

Why this changed, and what it cost. Numbers where there are any: what
was measured, on what machine, and what the alternative would have been.
Standing facts go in DESIGN.md and are referenced by section here —
a commit body is never edited again and nothing greps it.

Tested: <exact command> -> <exact result>, or: not run; <reason>
